@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Database health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### List cattle
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cattle

### Create a sample bovine (modifies the database)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cattle
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "earTag": "MX-001",
  "name": "Luna",
  "breed": "Holstein",
  "sex": "Hembra",
  "birthDate": "2024-03-15"
}

### Read one (replace 1 with the ID returned by POST)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cattle/1

### Update one
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/cattle/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "earTag": "MX-001",
  "name": "Luna",
  "breed": "Holstein",
  "sex": "Hembra",
  "birthDate": "2024-03-15"
}

### Delete one permanently
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cattle/1
